    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d818">

                <pb facs="0903" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg783"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Eddy to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-12-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>All cable communications broken. Telegraph operators on strike. Unconfirmed
                    report of serious rioting in Reval. Am attempting to instruct consular agent
                    Reval to cable details direct to Department of State. Petersburg quiet.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eddy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
